    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around The Secret Ingredient line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Отличный чай!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excellent tea!' Tasting the cognac hidden in the cup, Barinov declares the tea excellent.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А что это за чай-то?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what kind of tea is this?' Playing along for the cameras, Viktor asks what variety of tea it is. Then Lyova responds.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Это Сенча.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is Sencha.' Lyova keeps a straight face and calls it 'Sencha' green tea.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Молодцы, действуем по нашему плану.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good job, we are acting according to our plan.' Cheered up immediately, Viktor praises the team and says they will stick to this plan.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Давай, Костян, давай, давай!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, Kostyan, come on, come on!' Meanwhile, Lyova urges Kostya to hurry up with Max's errand.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Всё понятно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything is understood.' Kostya nods that he knows exactly what to do.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Займись седьмым столиком, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take care of the seventh table, please.' To cover the handoff, Lyova tells Kostya to go serve table seven.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Виктория Сергеевна, это записка вам.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Victoria Sergeyevna, this is a note for you.' In the dining room, Kostya hands Max's dramatic note to Victoria.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Этот чай очень хорошо успокаивает.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This tea calms very well.' Back in the kitchen, Viktor jokes that this 'tea' is wonderfully soothing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Я рад, что вам понравилось.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am glad that you liked it.' Lyova smiles and says he is glad the chef liked the brew.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Заварите мне ещё одну чашку.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Brew me one more cup.' Viktor promptly orders another cup of the spiked tea.",
      "gap": 0.4
